# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# optional user-supplied game assets (drop-in overrides)
# Everything here is ignored by default, EXCEPT the files the project ships
# with — those are whitelisted below on purpose (see README "Replacing the
# placeholder art"). Add a matching "!" line when you want a new drop-in file
# committed.
assets/textures/*.png
assets/sounds/*.mp3
assets/models/**/*.glb

# --- committed default art & audio (deliberate whitelist) ---
!assets/textures/student-character.png
!assets/textures/student-character-front.png
!assets/textures/teacher-character.png
!assets/textures/teacher-character-front.png
!assets/textures/ground-gravel.png
# full-size source renders + scenery (kept for future re-crops)
!assets/source-art/*.png
!assets/scenery/*.png
!assets/sounds/jump.mp3
!assets/sounds/collect.mp3
!assets/sounds/hit.mp3
!assets/sounds/teacher-alert.mp3
!assets/sounds/gameover.mp3
!assets/sounds/bg-music.mp3
